Interview dataset: Encouraging the development of Industrial Symbiosis
Networks in Slovenia – transition to the circular economy.
Erika Džajić Uršič, Zenodo, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.16910966.
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16910966

The authors' 25 English DOCX translations were converted to UTF-8 text.
Consecutive text runs within each paragraph were joined, surrounding whitespace
was trimmed, tabs and line breaks were preserved, and paragraphs became lines.
Empty paragraphs remain in the input for the demonstration's cleaning step, and
files were renamed from Organization N.docx to organization-NN.txt. The original
Slovene versions, interview protocols, and codebook are available from Zenodo.
